aps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onLongPressGesture(minimumDuration:pressing:perform:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onLongPressGesture","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumDuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pressing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ((","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"perform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","deprecated":true,"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onLongPressGesture(minimumDuration:pressing:perform:)","abstract":[],"title":"onLongPressGesture(minimumDuration:pressing:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/onlongpressgesture(minimumduration:pressing:perform:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"title":"Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reproduces the layer hierarchy measured from Origami’s runner render: a full-screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The card maps the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. If its touch-up position is within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"100 points of center on both axes, the placed graph’s Reset branch pulses Drag’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Reset input and returns the card to its origin."}]}}}